      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786410960457,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "endpoints\n\n/auth\n    - POST (login) {email, senha}\n\n/usuarios\n    - POST (criar conta) {nome, email, senha}\n    - DELETE \n    - PUT/PATCH {nome || senha}\n    - GET  => id obtido pelo token\n\n/urls-encurtadas\n    - POST {url_original, alias?}  -> res {UrlEncurtada}\n    - GET /{codigo} -> res (redirecionamento para a url original)\n    - GET => id obtido pelo token\n    - GET /alias/{possivel_alias}\n    - DELETE /{id}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6PEGyvXpLy2S4zrNmwej9",
      "originalText": "endpoints\n\n/auth\n    - POST (login) {email, senha}\n\n/usuarios\n    - POST (criar conta) {nome, email, senha}\n    - DELETE \n    - PUT/PATCH {nome || senha}\n    - GET  => id obtido pelo token\n\n/urls-encurtadas\n    - POST {url_original, alias?}  -> res {UrlEncurtada}\n    - GET /{codigo} -> res (redirecionamento para a url original)\n    - GET => id obtido pelo token\n    - GET /alias/{possivel_alias}\n    - DELETE /{id}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
